{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0044_1001_p", "source_sha256": "6ca546e7f4c6d143742ae13389617eba48d983f9f37357f23c8e67ed219b32fd", "ja": "志保、まだこんなところにいたのか。\n着替えないのか？", "zh": "志保！你还在这里啊。\n不换衣服吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0044_1002_033sih", "source_sha256": "c1e97e46b72de9d5fc25b9792411e1007465452292b52ec3b0dec88f12c8dc8f", "ja": "あ……{$P$}さん。\nお疲れさまです。", "zh": "啊……{$P$}先生。\n你辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0044_1003_p", "source_sha256": "3a50ece63998a1918cdfae0388d4f3c34338a1538d91847f3d21b87184eacf8a", "ja": "ライブが成功したのに、なんだか元気がないな。\nステージでミスしたことを、気にしているのか？", "zh": "演唱会明明很成功，你看起来却没什么精神呢。\n还在介意表演中失误的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0044_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55", "ja": "はい。", "zh": "是的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0044_1005_033sih", "source_sha256": "45ac78ae03e1492a312c20a4192ce5f3d5bb66c5ed7c4a369c7fa3265248ba93", "ja": "レッスンでは、1度もミスしなかったところを、\n本番で間違ってしまって……。", "zh": "在训练课程中一次也没失误过的地方，\n却在正式表演时出错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0044_1006_033sih", "source_sha256": "824c931dbd62057d88a5cdeaf1f91b5123215bd714b4ec2277a576d8db527e9f", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、気づきましたよね。\n本当にすみませんでした。", "zh": "{$P$}先生也发现了吧。\n真的非常抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0044_1007_p", "source_sha256": "f7951f15d9e6d6409f2b52034d5e2188f7473adeb8e983ddea77d4ab1d000baf", "ja": "でも、すぐにリカバリーできてたじゃないか。\n大したものだと思うけど……心残りがあるのか？", "zh": "但你不是马上就弥补回来了吗？\n我认为这是件很了不起的事……还是说你心里有遗憾？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0044_1008_033sih", "source_sha256": "c46d33411814e2e073e7727874be9294c4261223f79a614bf45788a8998723c3", "ja": "ええ。今の私にできる精一杯のことを、\nしてきたつもりです。でも、だからこそ……。", "zh": "是的。一直以来，我都秉持着对当下全力以赴的精神。\n也因为如此……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0044_1009_033sih", "source_sha256": "d998b14253cc5cf02d103db46ac17048a4e14f28fbea9f11a55bb7abf525fefb", "ja": "プロとして、完璧なステージにしたかったです。", "zh": "我才想以专业人士的身分，展现出完美的表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0044_1010_p", "source_sha256": "28bbfe51b59a4129684811d9ff179ae2353c7d8b178ce3708e3e087ac6597391", "ja": "志保。俺はさっきのステージを見て、\nこれから何度も、志保のライブを見たいと思った。", "zh": "志保，看了刚才的表演之后，我的感想是\n今后还想再多看几场志保的演唱会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0044_1011_p", "source_sha256": "12e1c2ca3b09eeca5988d072933f7cba3c74bf874c23671342a7c4603e41f37c", "ja": "きっと、ファンのみんなも同じだ。\n志保の努力は、ちゃんと伝わっていると思う。", "zh": "我想粉丝们一定也是一样的。\n志保的努力，大家一定都看在眼里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0044_1012_033sih", "source_sha256": "160a64ed88c99d9050695da8e6c64b712db217e4ae92f89b1cfc1d17305a4175", "ja": "……そうですか。\nありがとうございます、{$P$}さん。", "zh": "……是吗。\n谢谢你，{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0044_1013_033sih", "source_sha256": "a2fa77b29f86a7180411e40a192bfcb41cce17528c2623d017435494fe8d9b5f", "ja": "今になって、急に実感が湧いてきました。\n今日、このステージに立てたこと……。", "zh": "到现在我才突然涌现真实感。\n今天能站上这个舞台……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0044_1014_033sih", "source_sha256": "e3cd2cd8fa0ddd23b9267fb2daa86f930869b3d125b9f23db2913f7a5f9ce368", "ja": "私がこれまでやってきたことは、\nムダじゃなかったんだと思いました。", "zh": "我认为自己至今以来的努力，\n并没有白费。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0044_1015_p", "source_sha256": "11d39b87314173cf458640c4a5675eae39d76eb7c9e37a267219d7b71cf36976", "ja": "もちろん。\n努力に、ムダなものなんてないよ。", "zh": "那当然。\n努力是不会白费的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0044_1016_033sih", "source_sha256": "4ee93aea1897ffab5546abf1344ae0e7615f5afe3594c6867e6884fa2fac4231", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\n……でも私、まだ満足していませんから。", "zh": "谢谢你……\n不过我还没有满足。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0044_1017_033sih", "source_sha256": "487dcdece20c482d6258c9498c094c48b8752aae3235df6c3cdf53b82edb26d2", "ja": "もう一度振り付けをチェックしたいんですけど、\n少しだけ見てもらえますか？", "zh": "我想再对一次舞步，\n你可以帮我看看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0044_1018_p", "source_sha256": "17c84da07b4b85ccd71b12866f1408a1c3c012cc8d977e4dbd6626fd973f6d1b", "ja": "もちろん。でも、疲れてないか？\n明日にした方が……。", "zh": "当然可以，但你不累吗？\n明天再对比较好吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0044_1019_033sih", "source_sha256": "9148c799802963238bd47aff3a433d54ae7f61865edb686ffdc46a4bb7af1b09", "ja": "私のステージを何度でも見たいと言ったのは、\n{$P$}さんですよ。", "zh": "是{$P$}先生自己说\n想继续多看几场我的表演的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0044_1020_033sih", "source_sha256": "ee6dbdde32276080bddd52da28de6f83af2244c3b7005596a963e2e29027804c", "ja": "今さら、文句は言わないでくださいね。\n……ふふっ。", "zh": "事到如今，就别发牢骚了……\n呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
